# DOC-authored declaration and prefix-expression parser. Events are triples
# (tag, token ordinal, auxiliary value). The lexer supplies exact byte spans.
# The typed semantic pass is separate; this parser never evaluates source code.
fn pk(ts,i) = if(lt(i,quot(len(ts),3)),get(ts,mul(i,3)),0)
